  "cited_article_id": "generate-and-submit-claims",
  "reply": "Open **Billing > Claim Center**, go to the **Ready to Batch** tab, then click **Generate Claims**. Review any red error icons on the **Validation Queue** tab, click each flagged claim, correct the highlighted issues (e.g., missing modifiers, invalid IDs, unmapped diagnoses), and choose **Save & Re‑validate**. Once all claims validate, select them and click **Batch & Submit**. If errors persist despite correct data, verify the payer’s electronic format settings under **Billing > Payer Rules**, and review the **Clearinghouse Log** in **Reports** for specific rejection codes."
}
